PROJECT DESCRIPTION

StyX is an integrated IoT forensic framework that unifies two distinct
acquisition workflows — Android-based Smartwatches (via wireless ADB) and
Smart Assistant cloud data (Amazon Alexa / Fire TV) — into a single,
investigator-friendly platform. It extracts forensic artifacts including
system logs, GPS/sensor data, voice transcripts, audio recordings, and
complete file systems, with automatic hash verification and a built-in
web-based content viewer.

